Bound temporary prompt-logprob logits on memory-constrained native servers.

The default remains 1024 rows. Set VLLM_PROMPT_LOGPROBS_CHUNK_SIZE=128
for a large-vocabulary model sharing a 24 GB card with a large KV pool.
This tiles the LM head and scoring workspace, not the attention/context window.
Explicitly release each logits tile before allocating the next one.

Kind: compatibility
What: configurable prompt-logprob workspace and bounded tile lifetime
Upstream: none
Cut-against: 0.31.0
Retires-when: upstream exposes equivalent prompt-logprob memory control

